# Claude Code / shared agent guidance.
# Tracked: .claude/docs (Conventions, Building, Threading, Rendering, Architecture) and
# .claude/skills (dev, cr, send-pr) - these are the single source of truth for agent workflows.
# Ignored: local settings, agent worktrees, scratch backups.
# NOTE: this must be ".claude/*", not ".claude/". Git will not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a trailing-slash exclude makes the negations below unreachable.
.claude/*
!.claude/docs/
!.claude/skills/

# Lux files
*.log

